    "body": "## Motivation\n\nSince #42178, GLM-5.3-Flash runs with 256-token pages (64 * `index_kpool`). With `--speculative-draft-attention-backend trtllm_mha`, the trtllm_mha page check resets the page size to 64, and the DSA pool fails at startup:\n\n```\nAssertionError: DSA requires 64-token physical pages, got page_size=64 with index_kpool=4\n```\n\n## Modifications\n\n- Keep a DSA model's 64 * `index_kpool`-token page when trtllm_mha is the draft backend.\n- In `TRTLLMHAAttnBackend`, read a page over 128 tokens as consecutive 64-token pages.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nGLM-5.3-Flash NVFP4 on 2x B300 with a DFlash draft on trtllm_mha scores 0.927 on GSM8K, the same as a build from before #42178 that ran the draft on 64-token pages.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nN/A. The draft kernels run on 64-token pages, as they did before #42178.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Format your code according to the [Format code with pre-commit](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#format-code-with-pre-commit).\n- [ ] Add unit tests according to the [Run and add unit tests](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#run-and-add-unit-tests).\n- [ ] Update documentation according to [Write documentations](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#write-documentations).\n- [ ] Provide accuracy and speed benchmark results according to [Test the accuracy](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#test-the-accuracy) and [Benchmark the speed](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#benchmark-the-speed).\n- [x] Follow the SGLang code style [guidance](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#code-style-guidance).\n",
